      "content": "ok but that's basically just saying the president can do whatever they want without being watched. what about the other side? like, if i go with your suggestion, how am i supposed to handle the argument that this basically kills the whole idea of checks and balances and makes the executive branch a monarchy? isn't that a much more fundamental constitutional problem?",
